isendchocolateinternationallywithevri" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="canisendchocolateinternationallywithevri-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We know sweet treats make great gifts – but sadly, we’re unable to send any food items, including chocolate, to international destinations with Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What kind of chocolate travels best?-open answer" data-test-id="whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What kind of chocolate travels best?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatkindofchocolatetravelsbest-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Solid bars, truffles, or chocolate-covered snacks with long shelf lives are ideal. Avoid soft fillings in warmer weather.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isitsafetoshipchocolateinthesummer-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isitsafetoshipchocolateinthesummer" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isitsafetoshipchocolateinthesummer" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is it safe to ship chocolate in the summer?-open answer" data-test-id="isitsafetoshipchocolateinthesummer-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isitsafetoshipchocolateinthesummer-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is it safe to ship chocolate in the summer?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14